        "Therefore, the main difference between the two methods lies in the way that they return the content of each movie. Because the first one returns the raw source code, it will require a pre-processing phase to clean the data before diving into the analysis. The second method gives us directly the pre-processed content: it provides a clean semantic signal by removing technical artifacts that do not carry linguistic meaning, which makes it directly operational for NLP pipelines.\n",
