        "*-- Note: These qualitative patterns remain robust across different values of n_clusters (tested with 5, 7, and 10), confirming that the difference in cluster structure is fundamentally due to the underlying representations (NER noise vs SBERT semantics) rather than hyperparameter sensitivity.*\n"
