        "Moreover, there is one striking exception, where the 4th cluster is composed entirely of \"horror\" movies. This is a perfect illustration of the previously \"production bias\" hypothesis. The NER-based algorithm identified a specific horror franchise sharing the exact same cast/entities, creating a pure cluster. It didn't learn what \"horror\" is, but it just found a group of movies with the same actors/directors.\n",
